    {
      "id": "2124042864891982292",
      "text": "SFT is more like getting a haircut with a chainsaw than it is “fine-tuning”! Should just be built into primary training. \n\nAnd having a “system prompt” is silly! Default behavior should be sensible.\n\nThe above are already true for Tesla AI (not yet deserving of “super”). It is the most efficient AI on Earth.\n\nFSD V15 goes to wide release next month. It will be something special.",
      "created_at": "Sat Nov 21 07:30:56 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
      "media": [],
      "retweet": null,
      "quoted": null,
      "stats": {
        "retweet_count": 436,
