    {
      "id": "2124044780099285426",
      "text": "We’ve had monkeys playing video while drinking banana smoothies for 5 years. Not a bad life.",
      "created_at": "Sat Nov 21 07:38:33 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
      "media": [],
      "retweet": null,
      "quoted": {
        "id": "2124030861653999815",
        "text": "How it started vs how it's going\n\nIn April 2021, Neuralink showed Pager the macaque playing MindPong with his brain\n\nNow a Neuralink patient is flying a plane in GTA VI with 2 joysticks and 12 buttons of control, all with his brain\n\nBefore the implant, he used a mouth stick on an iPad\n\nNow he's literally playing with Neuralink telepathy\n\n\"Immediately, controlling a computer is like, boom, portal to the world. Like you immediately just get your portal to the world back\"",
